ous countries, such as the United States, Germany, Europe, and the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company was formerly known as Akar Tools Limited and changed its name to Akar Auto Industries Limited in November 2017. Akar Auto Industries Limited was incorporated in 1989 and is based in Aurangabad, India."}}